QUERY NAME: Query6
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT tlkpTestReqmt.*, tlkpTestReqmt.NoRequired
FROM tlkpProject INNER JOIN tlkpTestReqmt ON tlkpProject.ParentProject = tlkpTestReqmt.Buyer
WHERE (((tlkpProject.Program)<>"Commercial") AND ((tlkpTestReqmt.NoRequired)<>0));

